    {
      "id": "3ec1c44b218f",
      "name": "morning-briefing",
      "prompt": "Give the user a morning briefing with:\n\n## 1. Project Health\nRun health checks for each repo and report:\n- Signal Engine (~/Documents/code/signalengine): git status --short && uv run pytest -q -m \"not slow\" --no-header --tb=line -p no:cacheprovider 2>&1 | tail -10\n- LUX (~/Documents/code/lux): git status --short && npx jest --passWithNoTests --silent 2>&1 | tail -5\n- Prospector (~/Documents/code/prospector): git status --short && .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q --no-header 2>&1 | tail -10\n- Prospector .NET: cd store_platform && dotnet test src/Store.Tests/ --no-build 2>&1 | tail -5\n\n## 2. Yesterday \u2014 Self-Improvement Status\nRead the latest files in ~/.hermes/logs/maintenance/ and ~/.hermes/logs/reflection/:\n- **Latest gap-finding** ~/.hermes/logs/maintenance/gap-finding-*.json \u2014 any uncovered domains?\n- **Latest near-miss** ~/.hermes/logs/maintenance/near-miss-*.json \u2014 any untriggered policies?\n- **Yesterday's self-reflection** ~/.hermes/logs/reflection/*.md \u2014 what improvement items were suggested? Were they completed?\n- **Latest meta-improver outcome** ~/.hermes/meta/change-outcomes.jsonl \u2014 how many outcomes determined?\n- **Improvement velocity** ~/.hermes/meta/metrics.jsonl \u2014 what's the domain coverage trend?\n\n## 3. Carry-over from Yesterday\nCheck if yesterday's reflection had improvement items that are still open.\n\n## 4. Active tasks + blockers\nCheck ~/Documents/code/.hermes/OBJECTIVES.md + task queue.\n\nStructured output:\n---\n**Morning Briefing \u2014 [date]**\n\n**Yesterday:**\n- [bullet: project work]\n- [bullet: what the reflection proposed]\n- [bullet: whether those items got done]\n\n**Self-Improvement Health:**\n- Domain coverage: [X]% (change from yesterday: +/-)\n- Untriggered policies: [N]\n- Uncovered domains: [N]\n- Outcome velocity: [N pending, N determined]\n\n**Project Health:**\n- Signal: [pass/fail + count]\n- LUX: [pass/fail]\n- Prospector: [pass/fail + count + .NET count]\n\n**Carry-over from yesterday:** [open improvement items]\n\n**What are today's priorities?**\n---",
      "skills": [
        "autonomous-ai-agents/otto-operating-model"
      ],
      "skill": "autonomous-ai-agents/otto-operating-model",
      "model": null,
      "provider": null,
      "base_url": null,
      "script": null,
      "no_agent": false,
      "context_from": null,
      "schedule": {
        "kind": "cron",
        "expr": "0 9 * * *",
        "display": "0 9 * * *"
      },
